          <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
            <span data-id="pg089_n0021">Festa &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb; q&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ohet nga t&#xeb; tjerat, sepse lidhet me nj&#xeb; ngjarje t&#xeb; caktuar gazmore.</span>
            <span data-id="pg089_n0022">Dita e fest&#xeb;s dallon nga dit&#xeb;t e tjera sepse p&#xeb;rgatitet ushqim m&#xeb; i ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb;, veshjet dallojn&#xeb; nga ato t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rditshmet etj.</span>
            <span data-id="pg089_n0023">Gjat&#xeb; dit&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; festave, jemi t&#xeb; lumtur dhe festojm&#xeb; s&#xeb; bashku me prind&#xeb;rit, kush&#xeb;rinjt&#xeb;, miqt&#xeb; dhe shok&#xeb;t.</span>
            <span data-id="pg089_n0024">Zakonisht gjat&#xeb; festave marrim dhe japim dhurata, vall&#xeb;zojm&#xeb;, k&#xeb;ndojm&#xeb; etj.</span>
          </p>

          <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800 mt-4">
            <span data-id="pg089_n0026">Festat mund t&#xeb; jen&#xeb; individuale, familjare, shtet&#xeb;rore, komb&#xeb;tare, nd&#xeb;rkomb&#xeb;tare, fetare etj.</span>
            <span data-id="pg089_n0027">Festat individuale jan&#xeb; festa q&#xeb; i takojn&#xeb; nj&#xeb; individi, p.sh., festa e dit&#xeb;lindjes.</span>
            <span data-id="pg089_n0028">Festat shtet&#xeb;rore jan&#xeb; festa q&#xeb; feston nj&#xeb; shtet, p.sh., Pavar&#xeb;sia e Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>
            <span data-id="pg089_n0029">Festa komb&#xeb;tare &#xeb;sht&#xeb; fest&#xeb; q&#xeb; feston nj&#xeb; komb, nj&#xeb; popull kudo q&#xeb; ndodhet, p.sh., t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; shqiptar&#xeb;t q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb;p&#xeb;r vende t&#xeb; ndryshme t&#xeb; bot&#xeb;s festojn&#xeb; Pavar&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e Shqip&#xeb;ris&#xeb;.</span>
          </p>

          <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-gray-800 mt-4">
            <span data-id="pg089_n0031">Festa nd&#xeb;rkomb&#xeb;tare &#xeb;sht&#xeb; fest&#xeb; q&#xeb; festohet n&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; bot&#xeb;n, p.sh. Dita e Gruas.</span>
